  "descriptionShort": "Energy consumed by agriculture, forestry and fishing as a percentage of total final energy consumption.",
  "descriptionProcessing": "- We compute this indicator by dividing the energy consumed by agriculture, forestry and fishing by total final energy consumption (which excludes non-energy uses of fuels).\n- For regions, we sum both flows across the countries that report agricultural energy use, and then take the ratio. Regional values are only shown for years when those countries account for at least 70% of the region's reported final energy consumption.\n- We exclude a small number of country-years in the most recent years of data where agricultural energy use collapses due to incomplete source data (for example, India in 2023).",
